 Circus. That passes, but only just.","S-I1/N-C1: T1 Records to T2 Market is 89 m. S1 Harbour to T2 Harbour is 36 m. T1 Circus to S1 Circus is 119 m. All three are under 150 m, so the three lines form one connected network.","S1 is unchanged. The station gaps are 255, 220 and 215 m (S-S2 passes). Harbour sits at x 315 because the 200 m minimum to Skyport rules out Datum's x 340.","I did not put a T2 stop north of Harbour. The 300 m minimum would put it at z 265 or higher, and its platform would then cross the Crown Road junction, which ends at z 268. No plot needs one."],"sources":["538618090dd534247cab5493","ba506de42600790962a866a2","7dfdfdf13043a24e8e964b0b","8753ed1758ca27e6cf152279","e20799f1f673824d09ce452d","0e426f4211a2f1f25c328968","e54a1a5c3874c8a545458768"]},"ttft_ms":33075,"type":"result","duration_ms":47470,"uuid":"9d83544a-c479-48e2-a927-17fac10fca89","ttft_stream_ms":1121,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":1122,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
